  list:
  - inkJsonForCutscene: {fileID: 4900000, guid: f765c3b69ac69814ba33706b840201e8, type: 3}
    lettersList:
    - 'To Miss Amy,

      I didn''t think you''d understand me

      How could
      you ever even try

      I don''t wanna tiptoe but I don''t wanna hide

      But
      I don''t wanna feed this monstrous fire

      Just wanna let this story die

      And
      I''ll be alright

      We can''t be friends

      But I like to just pretend

      You
      cling to your papers and pens

      Wait until you like me again

      Wait
      for your love

      My love I''ll wait for your love'
    - 'To Mr Martin,

      Normally, I can keep my cool but tonight I''m wildin''

      I''ma
      be in a dangerous mood can you match my timing

      Telling me that you really
      ''bout it why try hide it

      Talk is cheap so show me that you understand
      how I like it

      Can you blow my mind

      Set off my whole body whole
      body

      Make me sweat

      Make me hotter

      Make me lose my breath

      Make
      me water'
    - 'To Mr Rian,

      All along it was a fever

      A cold sweat hot-headed
      believer

      I threw my hands in the air sai "Show me something"

      You
      said "If you dare come a litttle closer"

      Round and around and around
      and around we go

      Oh now tell me now tell me now tell me now you know

      Not
      really sure how to feel about it

      Something in the way you move

      Makes
      me feel like I can''t live without you

      And it takes me all the way

      I
      want you to stay'
  aftergameContentlist:
  - letterText: "Dear Mr Rian,\nI really enjoy your narrative...That makes me water...\nLove,
      \nTheodosia Hold"
    relativeNumber: 0
    relativeTag: 
  - letterText: Fake news
    relativeNumber: 1
    relativeTag: 
  - letterText: 'Dear John,

      Thanks for the food. Kids miss you.

      Love,

      Your
      wife'
    relativeNumber: -1
    relativeTag: Food
